#: ../../source/libraries/email.rst:153
msgid ""
"If you have word wrapping enabled (recommended to comply with RFC 822) "
"and you have a very long link in your email it can get wrapped too, "
"causing it to become un-clickable by the person receiving it. CodeIgniter"
" lets you manually override word wrapping within part of your message "
"like this::"
msgstr ""
